title Resume pedalling while already rolling at 20 km/h (level 3)

# Coasting at speed, then the rider starts pedalling again at 70 rpm.
# On a torque-sensor bike assist is there on the first push.
at 0 speed 20
at 3000 cadence 70
at 7000 cadence 0

end 8000

# Rolling start: above 5 km/h assist starts after 2 PAS pulses (~30 deg,
# ~75ms at 70 rpm). Upstream waited 90 deg (215ms) here too.
expect 3000 current == 0
expect 3100 current > 0
